          "Temperature lapse rate: 1.98 °C per 1 000 ft (6.5 °C per km) from sea level to the tropopause at 11 km / 36 090 ft, where the temperature is –56.5 °C. Above that it is constant at –56.5 °C up to 20 km (65 617 ft).",
